s 2928 1504 500 0 Add more instruments here
s 4288 208 100 0 Combine OIWFS CAR values
s 3616 96 100 0 Chris Mayer
s 4288 336 200 0 A&G Sequencer
s 3808 3104 100 0 $Id: agSeqCarOiwfs.sch,v 1.9 2013/11/12 17:24:50 gemvx Exp $
s 3632 304 100 0 Copyright
s 3632 272 100 0 Observatory
s 3632 240 100 0 Sciences Ltd.
s 4320 512 100 0 This schematic passes the selected OIWFS CAR value to the
s 4320 480 100 0 generic OIWFS activeC record.
s 2544 208 100 0 If any of the OIWFS CAR values process then the fanout
s 2544 176 100 0 record processes. It pulls in an index to tell it which OIWFS
s 2544 144 100 0 is currently selected and then triggers the appropriate output
s 2544 112 100 0 link so that the the relevant value and message field
s 2544 80 100 0 is copied to the generic CAR.
